      "content": "i dont even know why im typing this tbh. im just so goddamn tired. not like i need a nap, but like... every single part of me is just finished. i feel like i've been running a marathon for years and i've finally just run out of fuel. everything feels so heavy and pointless. i just want everything to stop.",
