    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, the numbers and the helplines just feel like more work... more things i have to do when i literally have nothing left to give. it's like everyone thinks there's a way to just 'recharge' but i've tried everything. i'm just hollow. i don't think there's a version of my life where i'm not this exhausted. it's just how i am now.",
